    "body": "Question from the sideline, how would “more” enhance semantics, or be clear(er)? It seems to be applicable to anything, which is typical for something that can represent everything, like a `div` or `span`.\r\n\r\nFor the problem itself, as element semantics have something permanent (a paragraph, heading, image, or other element doesn’t usually change form), and this seems to be about solving something temporary (what was “more” at time A doesn’t seem to be “more” anymore at time B), an element may not be a suitable choice, either. But that’s also a humble sideline read.",
